ot yet been finalised by the rapporteur Member States, and in light of the time required to complete the remaining steps in eac', true, '2026-09-02T00:00:00Z' from public.substancia_ativa where nome_canonico = 'FLUAZINAM' on conflict (substancia_id, celex) do nothing;
