 esta na Parte A; data anterior]: "Commission Directive 2004/58/EC included phenmedipham in Annex I to Directive 91/414/EEC as an', true, '2026-09-02T00:00:00Z' from public.substancia_ativa where nome_canonico = 'FLUDIOXONIL' on conflict (substancia_id, celex) do nothing;
